# Abysmal Onslaught — a "Play Deck" folder deck installed by Duels of the Planeswalkers (1998): a ready-made
# player deck that shipped in the expansion's files but was not offered in-game (the precon
# page: "users would need to open the game's files and move them into a different directory").
# designer: Tim McCracken (MicroProse, largely the Quality Assurance team — precon page)
# colours: B
# source: ../mage-go/data/preconstructed_decks.yaml shandalar.player_decks.other ["Abysmal
#   Onslaught"] [Tier 3 — mage-go's transcription of the expansion's Play Deck files]
